    "usage_prompt": "When analyzing an unfamiliar 3D occupancy algorithm, systematically evaluate it across these dimensions. Start from top-level modality, then drill down into architecture, view representation, transformation methods, fusion strategies, training approach, and finally evaluate its efficiency and robustness characteristics. This framework provides a comprehensive taxonomy to position any new method within the current research landscape.",
    
    "relationships": {
      "hierarchical_dependencies": {
